app-benchmarks/vkmark:drm - Build the DRM/KMS window-system backend
app-misc/streamchat:bot - Enable the integrated bot automation feature declaration; requires server.
app-misc/streamchat:cli - Install the interactive terminal client mode.
app-misc/streamchat:gui - Install the native Qt graphical client and local-server runtime.
app-misc/streamchat:server - Install the headless relay server mode and systemd unit.
app-misc/weightrail:graph - Install plotext for terminal graph rendering
app-misc/weightrail:gui - Install GTK 3, PyGObject, and Matplotlib for the graphical interface
app-misc/whacksmacker:geo - Include public geography content and built-in geography menu entries
app-misc/yazi:cli - Install the companion ya command-line utility.
games-board/lc0:cudnn - Enable the NVIDIA cuDNN backend
games-board/lc0:dnnl - Enable the oneDNN backend
games-board/lc0:ispc - Enable ISPC optimized kernels
games-board/lc0:networks - Install a pinned pre-trained neural network
games-board/lc0:openblas - Enable OpenBLAS support
media-sound/language-subtitles:cuda - Use an NVIDIA GPU for Whisper inference.
net-im/ferdium-bin:wayland - Run Ferdium through Electron's native Ozone Wayland backend
